  "prefLabel": "Eth 213.05 Decision on Motion for Reconsideration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 213.05 Decision on Motion for Reconsideration. The committee shall, at its next meeting, grant or deny a motion for reconsideration, or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration.\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
